Description-ml.UTF-8: ഇന്‍സ്റ്റളേഷന്‍ തുടരുക
Description-mr.UTF-8: अधिष्ठापना पुढे सुरू ठेवा
Description-nb.UTF-8: Fortsett installasjon
Description-ne.UTF-8: स्थापना पुन: प्रारम्भ गर्नुहोस्
Description-nl.UTF-8: De installatie hervatten
Description-nn.UTF-8: Fortsett installasjonen
Description-no.UTF-8: Fortsett installasjon
Description-oc.UTF-8: Reprendre l'installacion
Description-pa.UTF-8: ਇੰਸਟਾਲੇਸ਼ਨ ਮੁੜ-ਚਾਲੂ ਕਰੋ
Description-pl.UTF-8: Kontynuuj instalację
Description-pt.UTF-8: Retomar a instalação
Description-pt_BR.UTF-8: Continuar a instalação
Description-ro.UTF-8: Continuarea instalării
Description-ru.UTF-8: Возобновление установки
Description-se.UTF-8: Joatkke sajáiduhttima
Description-si.UTF-8: ස්ථාපනය නැවත අරඹමින්
Description-sk.UTF-8: Pokračovať v inštalácii
Description-sl.UTF-8: Nadaljuj z namestitvijo
Description-sq.UTF-8: Rimerr instalimin
Description-sr.UTF-8: Настави инсталацију
Description-sv.UTF-8: Återuppta installationen
Description-ta.UTF-8: நிறுவலை மீண்டும் தொடர்
Description-te.UTF-8: స్థాపనను కొనసాగించు
Description-tg.UTF-8: Идома додани насбкунӣ
Description-th.UTF-8: ดำเนินการติดตั้งต่อ
