Description-et.UTF-8: Saaleala loomine nurjus
Extended_description-et.UTF-8: Seadme ${DEVICE} partitsioonile #${PARTITION} ei õnnestunud saaleala luua...
Description-eu.UTF-8: Huts egin du swap lekua sortzean
Extended_description-eu.UTF-8: Ezin izan da swap lekua sortu ${DEVICE} gailuko ${PARTITION}. partizioan.
Description-fa.UTF-8: ایجاد فضای swap شکست خورد
Extended_description-fa.UTF-8: ساخت فضای swap از پارتیشن #${PARTITION} از ${DEVICE} شکست خورد.
Description-fi.UTF-8: Sivutustilan luonti ei onnistunut
Extended_description-fi.UTF-8: Sivutustilan luonti laitteelle ${DEVICE} osioon n:ro ${PARTITION} epäonnistui.
Description-fr.UTF-8: Échec de la création de l'espace d'échange
Extended_description-fr.UTF-8: La création de l'espace d'échange sur la partition n° ${PARTITION} de ${DEVICE} a échoué.
Description-ga.UTF-8: Níorbh fhéidir spás babhtála a chruthú
Extended_description-ga.UTF-8: Níorbh fhéidir spás babhtála a chruthú i ndeighilt #${PARTITION} de ${DEVICE}.
Description-gl.UTF-8: Non foi posíbel crear un espazo de intercambio
Extended_description-gl.UTF-8: Non foi posíbel crear o espazo de intercambio na partición núm. ${PARTITION} de ${DEVICE}.
Description-gu.UTF-8: સ્વેપ જગ્યા બનાવવામાં નિષ્ફળ
Extended_description-gu.UTF-8: ${DEVICE} નાં પાર્ટિશન #${PARTITION} માં સ્વેપ જગ્યા બનાવવાનું નિષ્ફળ.
Description-he.UTF-8: יצירת שטח החלפה נכשלה
Extended_description-he.UTF-8: הניסיון ליצור שטח החלפה במחיצה מס׳ ${PARTITION} בהתקן ${DEVICE} נכשל.
Description-hi.UTF-8: स्वैप जगह बनाने में असफल
Extended_description-hi.UTF-8: स्वैप जगह को पार्टीशनः #${PARTITION} में, उपकरणः ${DEVICE} में बनाने में असफल.
Description-hr.UTF-8: Stvaranje swap prostora nije uspjelo
Extended_description-hr.UTF-8: Stvaranje swap prostora na particiji #${PARTITION} uređaja ${DEVICE} nije uspjelo.
Description-hu.UTF-8: Cserehely létrehozása meghiúsult
Extended_description-hu.UTF-8: Cserehely létrehozása meghiúsult ${DEVICE} ${PARTITION}. partícióján.
Description-id.UTF-8: Gagal membuat sebuah ruang swap
Extended_description-id.UTF-8: Pembuatan ruang swap pada partisi #${PARTITION} dari ${DEVICE} gagal.
Description-is.UTF-8: Mistókst að búa til diskminnissneið (swap)
Extended_description-is.UTF-8: Mistókst að búa til swap diskminni á disksneið #${PARTITION} á ${DEVICE}.
Description-it.UTF-8: Creazione dell'area di swap non riuscita
Extended_description-it.UTF-8: Creazione dell'area di swap nella partizione n° ${PARTITION} di ${DEVICE} non riuscita.
Description-ja.UTF-8: スワップ領域の作成に失敗しました
Extended_description-ja.UTF-8: ${DEVICE} にあるパーティション ${PARTITION} のスワップ領域の作成に失敗しました。
Description-ka.UTF-8: swap-სივრცე ვერ შეიქმნა
Extended_description-ka.UTF-8: ვერ მოხერხდა swap-სივრცის შექმნა ${DEVICE} მოწყობილობის #${PARTITION} დანაყოფზე.
Description-kab.UTF-8: Timerna n tallunt n swap ur teddi ara
Extended_description-kab.UTF-8: Timerna n tallunt n swap deg uḥric #${PARTITION} n ${DEVICE} ur teddi ara.
Description-kk.UTF-8: Своп орын құру мүмкін болмады
Extended_description-kk.UTF-8: ${DEVICE} құрылғысының #${PARTITION} бөліміндегі своп орынды құру мүмкін болмады.
Description-km.UTF-8: បាន​បរាជ័យ​ក្នុង​ការ​បង្កើត​ទំហំស្វប
Extended_description-km.UTF-8: ការ​បង្កើត​ទំហំ​ស្វប​នៅ​ក្នុង​ភាគថាស #${PARTITION} របស់ ${DEVICE} បាន​បរាជ័យ​ហើយ ។
Description-kn.UTF-8: ಸ್ವಾಪ್ ಸ್ಥಳವನ್ನು ನಿರ್ಮಿಸುವಲ್ಲಿ ವಿಫಲವಾಗಿದೆ
Extended_description-kn.UTF-8: ${DEVICE}ನ #${PARTITION} ವಿಭಜನೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಸ್ವಾಪ್ ಸ್ಥಳದ ನಿರ್ಮಾಣ ಪ್ರಕ್ರಿಯೆ ವಿಫಲವಾಗಿದೆ.
Description-ko.UTF-8: 스왑 영역을 만드는데 실패했습니다
Extended_description-ko.UTF-8: ${DEVICE} 장치의 파티션 #${PARTITION}에 스왑 영역을 만드는데 실패했습니다.
Description-ku.UTF-8: Afirandina cihê swap serneket
Extended_description-ku.UTF-8: Afirandina cihê swap di partîsiyona #${PARTITION}·ya·${DEVICE}·serneket.
Description-lo.UTF-8: ສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ສະຫຼັບບໍ່ສຳເລັດ
Extended_description-lo.UTF-8: ສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ສະຫຼັບໃນພາທິຊັນ #${PARTITION} ຂອງ ${DEVICE} ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ
Description-lt.UTF-8: Nepavyko sukurti mainų (swap) vietos
Extended_description-lt.UTF-8: Mainų (swap) vietos kūrimas įrenginio ${DEVICE} skaidinyje Nr. ${PARTITION} nepavyko.
Description-lv.UTF-8: Neizdevās izveidot maiņvietu
Extended_description-lv.UTF-8: Maiņvietas izveide uz ${DEVICE} #${PARTITION} nodalījuma nav izdevusies.
Description-mk.UTF-8: Не успеав да направам swap простор
Extended_description-mk.UTF-8: Креирањето на swap просторот во партицијата бр. ${PARTITION} од ${DEVICE} не успеа.
Description-ml.UTF-8: ഒരു സ്വാപ് സ്പേയ്സ് സൃഷ്ടിക്കുന്നതില്‍ പരാജയപ്പെട്ടു
Extended_description-ml.UTF-8: ${DEVICE} ലെ #${PARTITION} ഭാഗത്തെ സ്വാപ് സ്പേയ്സിന്റെ സൃഷ്ടി പരാജയപ്പെട്ടു.
Description-mr.UTF-8: अदलाबदलीची जागा बनवणे असफल झाले
Extended_description-mr.UTF-8: ${DEVICE} च्या #${PARTITION} या विभाजनात अदलाबदलीची जागा बनवणे असफल झाले.
Description-nb.UTF-8: Klarte ikke å lage et veksleminneområde
Extended_description-nb.UTF-8: Klarte ikke å opprette et veksleminne på partisjon nr. ${PARTITION} på ${DEVICE}.
Description-ne.UTF-8: स्वाप खाली ठाउँ सिर्जना गर्न असफल भयो 
Extended_description-ne.UTF-8: ${DEVICE} को विभाजन #${PARTITION} मा स्वाप खाली ठाउँको सिर्जना असफल भयो ।
Description-nl.UTF-8: Aanmaken van het wisselgeheugen is mislukt
Extended_description-nl.UTF-8: Het aanmaken van het wisselgeheugen in partitie #${PARTITION} op ${DEVICE} is mislukt.
Description-nn.UTF-8: Klarte ikkje å oppretta vekselminneområde
Extended_description-nn.UTF-8: Oppretting av vekselminne på partisjon #${PARTITION} på ${DEVICE} feila.
Description-no.UTF-8: Klarte ikke å lage et veksleminneområde
Extended_description-no.UTF-8: Klarte ikke å opprette et veksleminne på partisjon nr. ${PARTITION} på ${DEVICE}.
Description-oc.UTF-8: Impossible de crear un espaci d'escambi
Extended_description-oc.UTF-8: La creacion de l'espaci d'escambi de la particion n° ${PARTITION} de ${DEVICE} a pas capitat.
Description-pa.UTF-8: ਸਵੈਪ ਥਾਂ ਬਣਾਉਣ ਵਿੱਚ ਅਸਫਲ
Extended_description-pa.UTF-8: ${DEVICE} ਦੇ ਪਾਰਟੀਸ਼ਨ #${PARTITION} ਵਿੱਚ ਸਵੈਪ ਥਾਂ ਬਣਾਉਣ ਲਈ ਅਸਫਲ।
Description-pl.UTF-8: Utworzenie przestrzeni wymiany nie powiodło się
Extended_description-pl.UTF-8: Tworzenie przestrzeni wymiany na partycji #${PARTITION} urządzenia ${DEVICE} nie powiodło się.
Description-pt.UTF-8: Falha ao criar um espaço para swap
Extended_description-pt.UTF-8: Falhou a criação do espaço para swap na partição #${PARTITION} de ${DEVICE}.
Description-pt_BR.UTF-8: Falha ao criar uma área de troca (swap)
Extended_description-pt_BR.UTF-8: A criação da área de troca (swap) na partição #${PARTITION} de ${DEVICE} falhou.
Description-ro.UTF-8: Eșec la crearea unui spațiu swap
Extended_description-ro.UTF-8: Crearea spațiului swap de pe partiția nr.${PARTITION} a ${DEVICE} a eșuat.
Description-ru.UTF-8: Не удалось создать раздел подкачки
Extended_description-ru.UTF-8: Не удалось создать раздел подкачки #${PARTITION} на устройстве ${DEVICE}.
Description-si.UTF-8: ස්වැප් ඉඩ නිර්මාණය අසාර්ථකයි
Extended_description-si.UTF-8: ${DEVICE} හී #${PARTITION} තුළ ස්වැප් ඉඩ සැකසීම අසාර්ථකයි.
Description-sk.UTF-8: Vytvorenie odkladacieho priestoru (swap) zlyhalo
Extended_description-sk.UTF-8: Vytvorenie odkladacieho priestoru (swap) na oblasti č.${PARTITION} na ${DEVICE} zlyhalo.
Description-sl.UTF-8: Ni bilo mogoče ustvariti izmenljivega prostora
Extended_description-sl.UTF-8: Ustvarjanje izmenljivega prostora na razdelku #${PARTITION} v ${DEVICE} ni uspelo.
Description-sq.UTF-8: Dështoi në krijimin e hapësirës swap
Extended_description-sq.UTF-8: Krijimi i hapësirës swap në ndarjen Nr. ${PARTITION} të ${DEVICE} dështoi.
Description-sr.UTF-8: Није креиран простор за додатну меморију
Extended_description-sr.UTF-8: Креирање простора за додатну меморију на партицији бр. ${PARTITION} уређаја ${DEVICE}није успело.
Description-sv.UTF-8: Kunde inte skapa ett växlingsutrymme
Extended_description-sv.UTF-8: Misslyckades med att skapa växlingsutrymme på partition nr. ${PARTITION} på ${DEVICE}.
Description-ta.UTF-8: இட மாற்று உருவாக்குதல் தோல்வியுற்றது
Extended_description-ta.UTF-8: ${DEVICE}-ன் #${PARTITION}-ல் இட மாற்று உருவாக்குதல் தோல்வியுற்றது.
Description-te.UTF-8: swap స్థలం  సృష్టించటం విఫలమైంది
Extended_description-te.UTF-8: ${DEVICE} యొక్క  #${PARTITION} విభజన  లో   swap స్థలం  సృష్టించటం విఫలమైంది.
Description-tg.UTF-8: Эҷодкунии фазои мубодила қатъ карда шуд
Extended_description-tg.UTF-8: Эҷодкунии фазои мубодила дар қисми диски #${PARTITION} дар ${DEVICE} бо нокомӣ дучор шуд.
Description-th.UTF-8: สร้างพื้นที่สลับไม่สำเร็จ
Extended_description-th.UTF-8: สร้างพื้นที่สลับในพาร์ทิชัน #${PARTITION} ของ ${DEVICE} ไม่สำเร็จ
Description-tl.UTF-8: Bigo ang pagbuo ng swap space
Extended_description-tl.UTF-8: Bigo ang pagbuo ng swap space sa partisyon #${PARTITION} ng ${DEVICE}.
Description-tr.UTF-8: Takas alanı oluşturulamadı
Extended_description-tr.UTF-8: ${DEVICE} aygıtının ${PARTITION} numaralı bölümünde takas alanı oluşturulamadı.
Description-ug.UTF-8: swap بوشلۇقى قۇرۇش مەغلۇپ بولدى
Extended_description-ug.UTF-8: ${DEVICE} ئۈسكۈنىسىدىكى #${PARTITION} رايوندىكى swap بوشلۇقى قۇرۇش مەغلۇپ بولدى.
Description-uk.UTF-8: Не вдалося створити розділ резервної пам’яті
Extended_description-uk.UTF-8: Не вдалося створити область резервної пам’яті на розділі #${PARTITION} пристрою ${DEVICE}.
Description-vi.UTF-8: Gặp lỗi khi chỗ tráo đổi
Extended_description-vi.UTF-8: Việc tạo chỗ tráo đổi trong phân vùng #${PARTITION} của ${DEVICE} bị lỗi.
Description-zh_CN.UTF-8: 创建交换空间失败
Extended_description-zh_CN.UTF-8: 在 ${DEVICE} 设备的第 ${PARTITION} 分区上创建交换空间失败。
Description-zh_TW.UTF-8: 無法建立置換空間
Extended_description-zh_TW.UTF-8: 在建立 ${DEVICE} 裝置的第 ${PARTITION} 分割區的置換空間時失敗了。

