Name: partman-basicfilesystems/mountoptions
Type: multiselect
Choices: ${descriptions}
Description: Mount options:
Extended_description: Mount options can tune the behavior of the file system.
Choices-C: ${options}
Description-am.UTF-8: የመጫኛ ምርጫዎች
Extended_description-am.UTF-8: የMount ምርጫዎች የፋይል ስርዓቱን ባህሪዎች መቃኘት ይችላሉ።
