Name: partman-basicfilesystems/progress_formatting
Type: text
Description: Creating ${TYPE} file system in partition #${PARTITION} of ${DEVICE}...
Description-am.UTF-8: የአካል ${DEVICE} በሆነው ክፋይ #${PARTITION} ላይ  የ${TYPE} ፋይል ስርዓትን በመፍጠር ላይ…
