Extended_description-zh_TW.UTF-8: 請選擇您想要刪除的 Volume Group。

Name: partman-lvm/vgdelete_novg
Type: error
Description: No volume group found
Extended_description: No volume group has been found.\n\nThe volume group may have already been deleted.
Description-am.UTF-8: ምንም የይዘት ግሩፕ አልተገኘም፡፡
Extended_description-am.UTF-8: ምንም የይዘት ግሩፕ አልተገኘም፡፡\n\nየይዘት ግሩፑ ምናልባት ተሰርዞ ይሆናል።
Description-ar.UTF-8: لم يعثر على أيّة مجموعة كتل
Extended_description-ar.UTF-8: لم يعثر على أيّة مجموعة كتل.\n\nمجموعة الكتل قد تكون محذوفةً مسبقاً.
Description-ast.UTF-8: Non atopáu grupu de volume
Extended_description-ast.UTF-8: Nun atopáu grupu de volume.\n\nEl grupu de volume puede ya tar esborráu.
Description-be.UTF-8: Не знойдзена груп тамоў
Extended_description-be.UTF-8: Не знойдзена ніводнай групы тамоў.\n\nГэтая група тамоў была выдалена раней.
Description-bg.UTF-8: Не е намерена група от томове
Extended_description-bg.UTF-8: Не беше намерена група от томове.\n\nТази група от томове вече е изтрита.
Description-bn.UTF-8: কোন ভলিউম গ্রুপ খুঁজে পাওয়া যায় নি
Extended_description-bn.UTF-8: কোন ভলিউম গ্রুপ খুঁজে পাওয়া যায় নি।\n\nভলিউম গ্রুপটি হয়ত বা ইতিমধ্যেই মুছে ফেলা হয়েছে।
Description-bs.UTF-8: Grupa particija nije pronađena
Extended_description-bs.UTF-8: Grupa particija nije pronađena.\n\nGrupa particija je možda već obrisana.
Description-ca.UTF-8: No s'ha trobat cap grup de volums
Extended_description-ca.UTF-8: No s'ha trobat cap grup de volums.\n\nPotser el grup de volums ja s'haja suprimit.
Description-cs.UTF-8: Nebyla nalezena žádná skupina svazků
Extended_description-cs.UTF-8: Nebyla nalezena žádná skupina svazků.\n\nSkupina svazků je již možná zrušena.
Description-cy.UTF-8: Ni chanfuwyd grŵp cyfrol
Extended_description-cy.UTF-8: Ni chanfuwyd unrhyw grŵp gyfrol.\n\nEfallai cafodd y grŵp cyfrol ei ddileu yn barod.
Description-da.UTF-8: Fandt ingen diskenhedsgrupper
Extended_description-da.UTF-8: Fandt ingen diskenhedsgrupper.\n\nDiskenhedsgruppen kan allerede være blevet slettet.
Description-de.UTF-8: Keine Volume-Gruppe gefunden
Extended_description-de.UTF-8: Es wurde keine Volume-Gruppe gefunden.\n\nDie Volume-Gruppe könnte bereits gelöscht sein.
Description-dz.UTF-8: བོ་ལུསམ་སྡེ་ཚན་འཚོལ་མ་ཐོབ།
Extended_description-dz.UTF-8: བོ་ལུསམ་སྡེ་ཚན་འཚོལ་མ་ཐོབ།\n\nབོ་ལུསམ་སྡེ་ཚན་འདི་ཡང་ཅིན་ཧེ་མ་ལས་རང་བཏོན་གཏང་གཏངམ་འོང་།
Description-el.UTF-8: Δε βρέθηκε ομάδα τόμων
Extended_description-el.UTF-8: Δε βρέθηκε ομάδα τόμων.\n\nΗ ομάδα τόμων πιθανόν έχει ήδη διαγραφεί.
Description-eo.UTF-8: Neniu datumportila grupo trovite
Extended_description-eo.UTF-8: Neniu datumportila grupo estas trovita.\n\nLa datumportila grupo eble jam estas forviŝita.
Description-es.UTF-8: No se ha encontrado un grupo de volúmenes
Extended_description-es.UTF-8: No se ha encontrado un grupo de volúmenes.\n\nEl grupo de volúmenes puede haberse borrado ya.
Description-et.UTF-8: Ei leitud ühtki köitegruppi
Extended_description-et.UTF-8: Ei leitud ühtki köitegruppi.\n\nSee köitegrupp võib juba kustutatud olla.
Description-eu.UTF-8: Ez da bolumen talderik aurkitu
Extended_description-eu.UTF-8: Ez da bolumen talderik aurkitu.\n\nBolumen taldea agian lehendik ezabatuta dago.
Description-fa.UTF-8: هیچ گروه volume یافت نشد.
Extended_description-fa.UTF-8: هیچ گروه volume یافت نشده است.\n\nگروه volume ممکن است قبلا حذف شده باشد.
Description-fi.UTF-8: Yhtään taltioryhmää ei löytynyt
Extended_description-fi.UTF-8: Yhtään taltioryhmää ei löytynyt.\n\nTaltioryhmä saattaa olla jo poistettu.
Description-fr.UTF-8: Aucun groupe de volumes trouvé
Extended_description-fr.UTF-8: Aucun groupe de volumes n'a été trouvé.\n\nLe groupe de volumes a peut-être déjà été supprimé.
Description-ga.UTF-8: Níor aimsíodh grúpa imleabhar ar bith
Extended_description-ga.UTF-8: Níor aimsíodh grúpa imleabhar ar bith.\n\nSeans gur scriosadh an grúpa imleabhar cheana.
Description-gl.UTF-8: Non se atopou ningún grupo de volumes
Extended_description-gl.UTF-8: Non se atopou ningún grupo de volumes.\n\nO grupo de volumes podería estar xa borrado.
Description-gu.UTF-8: કોઇ કદ સમૂહ મળ્યાં નહી
Extended_description-gu.UTF-8: કોઇ કદ સમૂહો મળ્યાં નથી.\n\nકદ સમૂહ કદાચ પહેલેથી દૂર કરેલ છે.
Description-he.UTF-8: לא נמצאה קבוצת כרכים
Extended_description-he.UTF-8: לא נמצאה קבוצת כרכים.\n\nכנראה שקבוצת כרכים זו כבר נמחקה.
Description-hi.UTF-8: कोई वॉल्यूम समूह नहीं मिला
Extended_description-hi.UTF-8: कोई भी वॉल्यूम समूह नहीं पाया गया है।\n\nवॉल्यूम समूह शायद मिटा दिया गया हो.
Description-hr.UTF-8: Nema pronađene grupe uređaja
Extended_description-hr.UTF-8: Nema pronađene grupe uređaja.\n\nGrupa uređaja je možda već obrisana.
Description-hu.UTF-8: Nincs kötetcsoport
Extended_description-hu.UTF-8: Nem találtam kötetcsoportot.\n\nA kötetcsoport törlése már megtörténhetett.
Description-id.UTF-8: Grup Volum tidak ditemukan
Extended_description-id.UTF-8: Grup Volum tidak ditemukan.\n\nGrup Volum mungkin telah dihapus.
Description-is.UTF-8: Enginn sýndardiskur fannst
Extended_description-is.UTF-8: Enginn sýndardiskur hefur fundist.\n\nHugsanlega hefur sýndardisknum þegar verið eytt.
Description-it.UTF-8: Non è stato trovato alcun gruppo di volumi
Extended_description-it.UTF-8: Non è stato trovato alcun gruppo di volumi.\n\nIl gruppo di volumi potrebbe essere già stato eliminato.
Description-ja.UTF-8: ボリュームグループが見つかりません
Extended_description-ja.UTF-8: ボリュームグループが見つかりませんでした。\n\nボリュームグループ名はすでに削除されているようです。
Description-ka.UTF-8: ტომების ჯგუფი ვერ ვიპოვე
Extended_description-ka.UTF-8: ვერ მოიძებნა ტომთა ჯგუფი.\n\nშესაძლებელია ტომთა ჯგუფი უკვე წაშლილია.
Description-kab.UTF-8: Ulac agraw n ubleɣ i yettwafen
Extended_description-kab.UTF-8: Ulac agraw n ubleɣ i yettwafen.\n\nAgraw n ubleɣ yezmer ad yili yettwakkes yakan.
Description-kk.UTF-8: Ешбір томдар тобы табылмады
Extended_description-kk.UTF-8: Ешбір тодар тобы табылған жоқ.\n\nТомдардың тобы өшірілген болуы мүмкін.
Description-km.UTF-8: រក​មិន​ឃើញ​ក្រុម​ភាគ
Extended_description-km.UTF-8: មិន​បាន​រក​មិន​ឃើញ​ក្រុម​ភាគ​ឡើយ ។\n\nក្រុម​ភាគ​ប្រហែល​ជា​ត្រូវ​បានលុប​រួចហើយ ។
Description-kn.UTF-8: ಯಾವುದೇ ಸಂಪುಟ ಸಮೂಹ ಪತ್ತೆಯಾಗಿಲ್ಲ.
Extended_description-kn.UTF-8: ಯಾವುದೇ ಸಂಪುಟ ಸಮೂಹ ಪತ್ತೆಯಾಗಿರುವುದಿಲ್ಲ.\n\nಬಹುಶಃ ಸಂಪುಟ ಸಮೂಹವನ್ನು ಆಗಲೇ ಅಳಿಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.
Description-ko.UTF-8: 볼륨 그룹을 찾을 수 없습니다
Extended_description-ko.UTF-8: 볼륨 그룹을 찾을 수 없습니다.\n\n볼륨 그룹이 이미 삭제했을 것입니다.
Description-ku.UTF-8: Komeke voluman nehate dîtin
Extended_description-ku.UTF-8: Tu koma voluman nehat dîtin.\n\nDibe ku ev koma voluman ji xwe hat jêbirin.
Description-lo.UTF-8: ບໍ່ພົບກຸ່ມໂວລຸມ
Extended_description-lo.UTF-8: ບໍ່ພົບກຸ່ມໂວລຸມໃດໆ\n\nກຸ່ມໂວລຸມດັ່ງກ່າວອາດຖືກລົບໄປແລ້ວ
Description-lt.UTF-8: Neradau nė vienos tomų grupės (Volume Group)
Extended_description-lt.UTF-8: Neradau nė vienos tomų grupės (Volume Group).\n\nTomų grupė (Volume Group) galėjo būti jau išmesta.
Description-lv.UTF-8: Nav sējumu grupu
Extended_description-lv.UTF-8: Neviena sējumu grupa nav atrasta.\n\nIespējams, šī sējumu grupa jau ir izdzēsta.
Description-mk.UTF-8: Не беше најдена просторна групи
Extended_description-mk.UTF-8: Не беше најдена просторна група.\n\nПросторната група можеби е веќе избришана.
Description-ml.UTF-8: വാള്യം ഗ്രൂപ്പൊന്നും കണ്ടില്ല
Extended_description-ml.UTF-8: വാള്യം ഗ്രൂപ്പുകളൊന്നും കണ്ടില്ല.\n\nവാള്യം ഗ്രൂപ്പ് നേരത്തേ തന്നെ നീക്കം ചെയ്യപ്പെട്ടിട്ടുണ്ടാവാം.
Description-mr.UTF-8: कोणताही खंड गट सापडला नाही
Extended_description-mr.UTF-8: कोणताही खंड गट सापडला नाही.\n\nहा खंड गट बहुदा आधीच काढून टाकलेला असावा.
Description-nb.UTF-8: Fant ingen grupperte dataområder
Extended_description-nb.UTF-8: Fant ingen grupperte dataområder.\n\nDet grupperte dataområdet er kanskje slettet allerede.
Description-ne.UTF-8: कुनै भोल्युम समूह फेला परेन
Extended_description-ne.UTF-8: कुनै भोल्युम समूह फेला परेन ।\n\nभोल्युम समूह पहिल्यै मेटिसकेको हुनेछ ।
Description-nl.UTF-8: Er is geen volumegroep gevonden
Extended_description-nl.UTF-8: Er is geen volumegroep gevonden.\n\nMisschien is deze volumegroep reeds verwijderd.
Description-nn.UTF-8: Fann ingen grupperte dataområde
Extended_description-nn.UTF-8: Fann ingen grupperte dataområde.\n\nDet grupperte dataområdet er kanskje allereie vorte sletta.
Description-no.UTF-8: Fant ingen grupperte dataområder
Extended_description-no.UTF-8: Fant ingen grupperte dataområder.\n\nDet grupperte dataområdet er kanskje slettet allerede.
Description-oc.UTF-8: Pas de grop de volum pas trobat
Extended_description-oc.UTF-8: Cap de grop de volums pas trobat.\n\nBenlèu que lo grop de volums ja es suprimit.
Description-pa.UTF-8: ਕੋਈ ਵਾਲੀਅਮ ਗਰੁੱਪ ਨਹੀਂ ਲੱਭਿਆ
Extended_description-pa.UTF-8: ਕੋਈ ਵਾਲੀਅਮ ਗਰੁੱਪ ਨਹੀਂ ਲੱਭਿਆ।\n\nਵਾਲੀਅਮ ਗਰੁੱਪ ਪਹਿਲਾਂ ਹੀ ਹਟਾਇਆ ਲੱਗਦਾ ਹੈ।
Description-pl.UTF-8: Nie znaleziono grupy woluminów
Extended_description-pl.UTF-8: Nie znaleziono żadnej grupy woluminów.\n\nGrupa woluminów mogła zostać już usunięta.
Description-pt.UTF-8: Não foi encontrado nenhum grupo de volumes
Extended_description-pt.UTF-8: Não foi encontrado nenhum grupo de volumes.\n\nO grupo de volumes pode já ter sido apagado.
Description-pt_BR.UTF-8: Nenhum grupo de volumes encontrado
Extended_description-pt_BR.UTF-8: Nenhum grupo de volumes foi encontrado.\n\nO grupo de volumes pode já ter sido excluído.
Description-ro.UTF-8: Nu s-a găsit un grup de volume
Extended_description-ro.UTF-8: Nu a fost găsit nici un grup de volume.\n\nEste posibil ca Grupul de volume să fi fost deja șters.
Description-ru.UTF-8: Группа томов не найдена
Extended_description-ru.UTF-8: Группа томов не найдена.\n\nЭта группа томов возможно уже удалена.
Description-si.UTF-8: කිසිඳු වෙළුම් කණ්ඩායමක් හමු නොවිනි
Extended_description-si.UTF-8: කිසිඳු වෙළුම් කණ්ඩායමක් හමු නොවිනි\n\nවෙළුම් කණ්ඩායම දැනටමත් මකාදමා තිබිය හැක.
Description-sk.UTF-8: Nebola nájdená žiadna skupina zväzkov
Extended_description-sk.UTF-8: Nebola nájdená žiadna skupina zväzkov.\n\nSkupina zväzkov je už možno zmazaná.
Description-sl.UTF-8: Nobene skupine nosilcev ni bilo mogoče najti
Extended_description-sl.UTF-8: Nobene skupine nosilcev ni bilo mogoče najti.\n\nTo ime skupine nosilcev je morda že izbrisano.
Description-sq.UTF-8: Nuk u gjet asnjë Grup Volumi
Extended_description-sq.UTF-8: Nuk u gjet asnjë Grup Volumi.\n\nGrupi i Volumit mund të jetë fshirë më parë.
Description-sr.UTF-8: Није пронађена група волумена
Extended_description-sr.UTF-8: Није пронађена група волумена.\n\nГрупа волумена је можда већ обрисана.
Description-sv.UTF-8: Hittade ingen volymgrupp
Extended_description-sv.UTF-8: Hittade ingen volymgrupp.\n\nVolymgruppen kan redan ha varit borttagen.
Description-ta.UTF-8: தொகுதிப் பிரிவு ஏதும் காணவில்லை
Extended_description-ta.UTF-8: தொகுதிப் பிரிவு ஏதும் கண்டு பிடிக்கப் படவில்லை.\n\nதொகுதிப் பிரிவு ஏற்கெனவே நீக்கப் பட்டு இருக்கலாம்.
Description-te.UTF-8: Volume group కనబడలేదు
Extended_description-te.UTF-8: Volume group కనబడలేదు\n\nVolume group తొలగించి వుండవచ్చు.
Description-tg.UTF-8: Ягон гурӯҳи ҳаҷмҳо ёфт нашуд
Extended_description-tg.UTF-8: Ягон гурӯҳи ҳаҷмҳо ёфт нашуд.\n\nЭҳтимол аст, ки гурӯҳи ҳаҷм аллакай нест шудааст.
Description-th.UTF-8: ไม่พบกลุ่มโวลุม
Extended_description-th.UTF-8: ไม่พบกลุ่มโวลุมใดๆ\n\nกลุ่มโวลุมดังกล่าวอาจถูกลบไปแล้ว
Description-tl.UTF-8: Walang nahanap na volume group
Extended_description-tl.UTF-8: Walang nahanap na volume group.\n\nMaaaring natanggal na ang volume group.
Description-tr.UTF-8: Herhangi bir cilt grubu bulunamadı
Extended_description-tr.UTF-8: Herhangi bir cilt grubu bulunamadı.\n\nBu cilt grubu daha önceden silinmiş olabilir.
Description-ug.UTF-8: دىسكا گۇرۇپپىسىنى تاپالمىدى.
Extended_description-ug.UTF-8: دىسكا گۇرۇپپىسى تېپىلمىدى.\n\nدىسكا گۇرۇپپىسى ئۆچۈرۈلگەن بولۇشى مۇمكىن.
Description-uk.UTF-8: Не знайдена група томів
Extended_description-uk.UTF-8: Відсутні групи томів.\n\nЦя група томів, можливо, вже вилучена.
Description-vi.UTF-8: Không tìm thấy nhóm khối tin
Extended_description-vi.UTF-8: Không tìm thấy nhóm khối tin.\n\nNhóm khối tin này có thể đã bị xóa.
Description-zh_CN.UTF-8: 未找到卷组
Extended_description-zh_CN.UTF-8: 没有找到卷组。\n\n卷组可能已被删除。
Description-zh_TW.UTF-8: 未能找到 Volume Group
Extended_description-zh_TW.UTF-8: 未能找到任何的 Volume Group。\n\n該 Volume Group 也許早已被刪除了。

Name: partman-lvm/vgextend_error
Type: error
Description: Error while extending volume group
Extended_description: The physical volume ${PARTITION} could not be added to the selected volume group.
Description-am.UTF-8: የይዘት ግሩፑ ሲጨመር ችግር አጋጥሟል
Extended_description-am.UTF-8: አካላዊ ይዘት ${PARTITION} በተመረጠው የይዘት ግሩፕ ላይ ሊጨመር አልቻለም፡፡
Description-ar.UTF-8: خطأ أثناء تمديد مجموعة الكتل
Extended_description-ar.UTF-8: تعذّرت إضافة الكتلة المادّيّة ${PARTITION} إلى مجموعة الكتل المحددة.
Description-ast.UTF-8: Fallu mientres s'extendía grupu de volume
Extended_description-ast.UTF-8: El volume físicu ${PARTITION} nun puede amestase al grupu de volume seleicionáu.
Description-be.UTF-8: Памылка пашырэння групы тамоў.
Extended_description-be.UTF-8: Фізіччы том ${PARTITION} не можа быць дададзены ў вылучаную групу тамоў.
Description-bg.UTF-8: Грешка при разширяване на група от томове
Extended_description-bg.UTF-8: Физическият том ${PARTITION} не може да бъде добавен към избраната група от томове.
Description-bn.UTF-8: ভলিউম গ্রুপ সম্প্রসারিত করার সময় সমস্যা হয়েছে
Extended_description-bn.UTF-8: প্রকৃত ভলিউম ${PARTITION}-কে নির্বাচিত ভলিউম গ্রুপে যোগ করা যায় নি।
Description-bs.UTF-8: Greška pri proširivanju grupe particija
Extended_description-bs.UTF-8: Fizički particija ${PARTITION} se ne može dodati odabranoj grupi particija.
Description-ca.UTF-8: S'ha produït un error en estendre el grup de volums
Extended_description-ca.UTF-8: No s'ha pogut afegir el volum físic ${PARTITION} al grup de volums seleccionat.
Description-cs.UTF-8: Chyba při rozšiřování skupiny svazků
Extended_description-cs.UTF-8: Fyzický svazek ${PARTITION} nemohl být přidán do vybrané skupiny svazků.
Description-cy.UTF-8: Gwall wrth ymestyn y grŵp cyfrol
Extended_description-cy.UTF-8: Methwyd ychwanegu'r cyfrol corfforol ${PARTITION} i'r grŵp cyfrol a ddewiswyd.
Description-da.UTF-8: Fejl under udvidelse af diskenhedsgruppe
Extended_description-da.UTF-8: Den fysiske diskenhed ${PARTITION} kunne ikke føjes til den valgte diskenhedsgruppe.
Description-de.UTF-8: Fehler beim Erweitern einer Volume-Gruppe
Extended_description-de.UTF-8: Das physikalische Volume ${PARTITION} konnte der ausgewählten Volume-Gruppe nicht hinzugefügt werden.
Description-dz.UTF-8: བོ་ལུསམ་སྡེ་ཚན་རྒྱ་བསྐྱེད་འབདཝ་ད་འཛོལ་བ།
Extended_description-dz.UTF-8: དངོས་ཅན་བོ་ལུསམ་${PARTITION}འདི་སེལ་འཐུ་འབད་ཡོད་པའི་སྐད་ཤུགས་སྡེ་ཚན་ལུ་ཁ་སྐོང་འབད་མི་བཏུབ་པས།
Description-el.UTF-8: Σφάλμα κατά την επέκταση της ομάδας τόμων
Extended_description-el.UTF-8: Δεν ήταν δυνατή η προσθήκη του φυσικού τόμου ${PARTITION} στην επιλεγμένη ομάδα τόμων.
Description-eo.UTF-8: Eraro dum ampleksigo de datumportila grupo
Extended_description-eo.UTF-8: La konkreta datumportilo ${PARTITION} ne povis esti aldonata al la elektita datumportila grupo.
Description-es.UTF-8: Se ha producido un error al extender el grupo de volúmenes
Extended_description-es.UTF-8: No se pudo añadir el volumen físico ${PARTITION} al grupo de volúmenes seleccionado.
Description-et.UTF-8: Köitegrupi laiendamisel ilmnes viga
Extended_description-et.UTF-8: Füüsilist köidet ${PARTITION} polnud võimalik valitud köitegruppi lisada.
Description-eu.UTF-8: Errorea bolumen taldea hedatzean
Extended_description-eu.UTF-8: Ezin izan zaio ${PARTITION} bolumen fisikoa gehitu hautatutako bolumen taldeari.
Description-fa.UTF-8: خطا در هنگام توسیع گروه volume
Extended_description-fa.UTF-8: Physical volume ${PARTITION} نمی تواند به volume group انتخاب شده اضافه شود.
Description-fi.UTF-8: Virhe laajennettaessa taltioryhmää
Extended_description-fi.UTF-8: Fyysistä taltiota ${PARTITION} ei voitu lisätä valittuun taltioryhmään.
Description-fr.UTF-8: Erreur lors de l'extension du groupe de volumes
Extended_description-fr.UTF-8: Le volume physique ${PARTITION} ne peut pas être ajouté au groupe de volumes sélectionné.
Description-ga.UTF-8: Earráid agus grúpa imleabhar á fhairsingiú
Extended_description-ga.UTF-8: Níorbh fhéidir imleabhar fisiceach ${PARTITION} a chur leis an ngrúpa imleabhar roghnaithe.
Description-gl.UTF-8: Erro ao aumentar o grupo de volumes
Extended_description-gl.UTF-8: Non foi posíbel engadir o volume físico ${PARTITION} ao grupo de volumes escollido.
Description-gu.UTF-8: કદ સમૂહો વિસ્તારતી વખતે ક્ષતિ
Extended_description-gu.UTF-8: ભૌતિક કદ ${PARTITION} પસંદ કરેલ કદ સમૂહમાં ઉમેરી શકાતું નથી.
Description-he.UTF-8: אירעה שגיאה בזמן הרחבת קבוצת כרכים
Extended_description-he.UTF-8: לא ניתן להוסיף את הכרך הפיזי ${PARTITION} לקבוצת הכרכים הנבחרת.
Description-hi.UTF-8: वॉल्यूम समूह का आकार बढ़ाते समय त्रुटि
Extended_description-hi.UTF-8: फिज़िकल वॉल्यूम ${PARTITION} को चुने गये वॉल्यूम समूह में नहीं जोड़ा जा सका.
Description-hr.UTF-8: Greška pri povećavanju grupe uređaja
Extended_description-hr.UTF-8: Fizički uređaj ${PARTITION} nije moguće dodati odabranoj grupi uređaja.
Description-hu.UTF-8: Hiba a kötetcsoport kiterjesztésekor
Extended_description-hu.UTF-8: A fizikai kötet (${PARTITION}) kiválasztott kötetcsoportba felvétele meghiúsult.
Description-id.UTF-8: Terjadi kesalahan saat memperbesar Grup Volum
Extended_description-id.UTF-8: Volum Fisik ${PARTITION} tidak dapat ditambahkan pada Grup Volum yang dipilih.
Description-is.UTF-8: Villa kom upp við stækkun sýndardisksins
Extended_description-is.UTF-8: Ekki reyndist unnt að bæta rauneintakinu ${PARTITION} við valinn sýndardisk.
Description-it.UTF-8: Errore durante l'estensione del gruppo di volumi
Extended_description-it.UTF-8: Non è stato possibile aggiungere il volume fisico ${PARTITION} al gruppo di volumi selezionato.
Description-ja.UTF-8: ボリュームグループの拡張中のエラー
Extended_description-ja.UTF-8: 物理ボリューム ${PARTITION} を選択されたボリュームグループに追加できませんでした。
Description-ka.UTF-8: შეცდომა ტომთა ჯგუფის გაზრდისას
Extended_description-ka.UTF-8: ფიზიკური დისკწამყვანი ${PARTITION} ვერ დაემატა არჩეულ ტომთა ჯგუფს.
Description-kab.UTF-8: Tella-d tuccḍa lawn n usiɣzef n ugraw n ubleɣ
Extended_description-kab.UTF-8: Ableɣ aɣaran ${PARTITION} ur yezmir ara ad yettwernu ɣer ugraw n ubleɣ i yettwafernen.
Description-kk.UTF-8: Томдарды кеңейту кезінде қате кетті
Extended_description-kk.UTF-8: ${PARTITION} физикалық томын таңдалған томдар тобына қосу сәтсіз аяқталды.
Description-km.UTF-8: កំហុស​ខណៈពេល​ពង្រីក​ក្រុម​ភាគ
Extended_description-km.UTF-8: មិន​អាច​បន្ថែម​ភាគ​ពិត ${PARTITION} ទៅ​ក្រុម​ភាគ​ដែល​បាន​ជ្រើស​បាន​ឡើយ ។
Description-kn.UTF-8: ಶೇಖರಣಾ ಪರಿಮಾಣ ಸಮೂಹವನ್ನು  ವಿಸ್ತರಿಸುವಾಗ ದೋಷಊಂಟಾಗಿದೆ
Extended_description-kn.UTF-8: ${PARTITION} ಭೌತಿಕ ಸಂಪುಟವನ್ನು ಆಯ್ಕೆ ಮಾಡಲಾದ ಸಂಪುಟ ಸಮೂಹಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿಸಲು ಸಾಧ್ಯವಾಗಿಲ್ಲ.
Description-ko.UTF-8: 볼륨 그룹 늘리는데 오류가 발생했습니다
Extended_description-ko.UTF-8: ${PARTITION} 물리 볼륨을 선택한 볼률 그룹에 추가할 수 없습니다.
Description-ku.UTF-8: Di firehkirina koma voluman çewtiyek derket holê
Extended_description-ku.UTF-8: lêzêdekirina nirxa fizîkal  ${PARTITION} ji bo komên destnîşankirî , biserneket.
Description-lo.UTF-8: ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂະນະຂະຫຍາຍກຸ່ມໂວລຸມ
Extended_description-lo.UTF-8: ບໍ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມ physical volume ${PARTITION} ເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມໂວລຸມທີ່ເລືອກ
Description-lt.UTF-8: Klaida bandant išplėsti tomų grupę (Volume Group)
Extended_description-lt.UTF-8: Nepavyko pridėti fizinio tomo (physical volume) ${PARTITION} prie pasirinktos tomų grupės (Volume Group).
Description-lv.UTF-8: Kļūda, paplašinot sējumu grupu
Extended_description-lv.UTF-8: Neizdevās pievienot fizisko sējumu ${PARTITION} izvēlētajai sējumu grupai.
Description-mk.UTF-8: Грешка при проширување на просторната група
Extended_description-mk.UTF-8: Физичкиот простор ${PARTITION} не можеше да биде додаден во одбраната просторна група.
Description-ml.UTF-8: വാള്യം ഗ്രൂപ്പിന്റെ വികസനത്തില്‍ തെറ്റ്
Extended_description-ml.UTF-8: ${PARTITION} ഭൌതിക വാള്യം തെരഞ്ഞെടുത്ത വാള്യം ഗ്രൂപ്പിലേക്ക് കൂട്ടിച്ചേര്‍ക്കാന്‍ കഴിഞ്ഞില്ല.
Description-mr.UTF-8: खंड गट वाढवताना त्रुटी
Extended_description-mr.UTF-8: ${PARTITION} हा भौतिक खंड निवडलेल्या खंड गटात जमा करता आला नाही.
Description-nb.UTF-8: Feil ved utvidelsen av det grupperte dataområdet
Extended_description-nb.UTF-8: Det fysiske dataområdet ${PARTITION} kunne ikke legges til det valgte grupperte dataområdet.
Description-ne.UTF-8: भोल्युम समूह विस्तारमा त्रुटि
Extended_description-ne.UTF-8: भौतिक भोल्युम ${PARTITION} चयन भएको भोल्युम समूहमा थपिन सक्दैन ।
Description-nl.UTF-8: Fout bij het uitbreiden van de volumegroep
Extended_description-nl.UTF-8: Het fysieke volume ${PARTITION} kon niet aan de geselecteerde volumegroep toegevoegd worden.
Description-nn.UTF-8: Feil under utvidinga av det grupperte dataområdet
Extended_description-nn.UTF-8: Det fysiske dataområdet ${PARTITION} kunne ikkje leggjast til det valde grupperte dataområdet.
Description-no.UTF-8: Feil ved utvidelsen av det grupperte dataområdet
Extended_description-no.UTF-8: Det fysiske dataområdet ${PARTITION} kunne ikke legges til det valgte grupperte dataområdet.
Description-oc.UTF-8: Error pendent l'espandiment del grop de volums
Extended_description-oc.UTF-8: Lo volum fisic ${PARTITION} se pòt pas apondre al grop de volums seleccionat.
Description-pa.UTF-8: ਵਾਲੀਅਮ ਗਰੁੱਪ ਵਧਾਉਣ ਸਮੇਂ ਗਲਤੀ
Extended_description-pa.UTF-8: ਚੁਣੇ ਵਾਲੀਅਮ ਵਿੱਚ ਫਿਜ਼ੀਕਲ ਵਾਲੀਅਮ ${PARTITION} ਸ਼ਾਮਲ ਨਹੀਂ ਕੀਤੀ ਜਾ ਸਕਦੀ।
Description-pl.UTF-8: Błąd podczas powiększania grupy woluminów
Extended_description-pl.UTF-8: Fizyczny wolumin ${PARTITION} nie mógł zostać dodany do wybranej grupy woluminów.
Description-pt.UTF-8: Ocorreu um erro ao estender o grupo de volumes
Extended_description-pt.UTF-8: O volume físico ${PARTITION} não pode ser adicionado ao grupo de volumes escolhido.
Description-pt_BR.UTF-8: Erro estendendo o grupo de volumes
Extended_description-pt_BR.UTF-8: Não foi possível adicionar o volume físico ${PARTITION} ao grupo de volumes selecionado.
Description-ro.UTF-8: Eroare în timpul extinderii grupului de volume
Extended_description-ro.UTF-8: Volumul fizic ${PARTITION} nu a putut fi adăugat la Grupul de volume selectat.
Description-ru.UTF-8: Ошибка при расширении группы томов
Extended_description-ru.UTF-8: Не удалось добавить физический том ${PARTITION} в выбранную группу томов.
Description-si.UTF-8: වෙළුම් කණ්ඩායම දිගු කිරීමේ දෝශයක් ඇතිවිය
Extended_description-si.UTF-8: තෝරාගත් වෙළුම් කණ්ඩායමට ${PARTITION} භෞතික කොටස එක් කල නොහැක.
Description-sk.UTF-8: Chyba pri rozširovaní skupiny zväzkov
Extended_description-sk.UTF-8: Fyzický zväzok ${PARTITION} sa nedal pridať do zvolenej skupiny zväzkov.
Description-sl.UTF-8: Napaka pri razširjanju skupine nosilcev
Extended_description-sl.UTF-8: Fizičnega nosilca ${PARTITION} nisem mogel dodati k izbrani skupini nosilcev.
Description-sq.UTF-8: Gabim gjatë zgjerimit të grupit të volumit
Extended_description-sq.UTF-8: Volumi fizik ${PARTITION} nuk mund ti shtohej Grupit të zgjedhur të Volumit.
Description-sr.UTF-8: Грешка при проширењу групе волумена
Extended_description-sr.UTF-8: Физички волумен ${PARTITION} не може бити додат изабраној групи волумена.
Description-sv.UTF-8: Fel vid utökning av volymgrupp
Extended_description-sv.UTF-8: Den fysiska volymen ${PARTITION} kunde inte läggas till i den valda volymgruppen.
Description-ta.UTF-8: தொகுதிப் பிரிவு விஸ்தரிப்பு போது பிழை
Extended_description-ta.UTF-8: பௌதிக தொகுதி ${PARTITION} ஐ தேர்ந்தெடுத்த தொகுதிப் பிரிவுடன் சேர்க்க இயலவில்லை.
Description-te.UTF-8: Volume group విస్తరణలో  దోషం ఏర్పడింది
Extended_description-te.UTF-8:  విస్తరించదలచిన  Volume group లో Physical volume ${PARTITION} జతచేయుట వీలుకాలేదు.
Description-tg.UTF-8: Ҳангоми васеъкунии гурӯҳи ҳаҷм хато ба вуҷуд омад
Extended_description-tg.UTF-8: Қисмбандии ҷисмонии ${PARTITION} ба гурӯҳи интихобшудаи ҳаҷмҳо илова карда нашуд.
Description-th.UTF-8: เกิดข้อผิดพลาดขณะขยายกลุ่มโวลุม
Extended_description-th.UTF-8: ไม่สามารถเพิ่มโวลุมจริง ${PARTITION} เข้าในกลุ่มโวลุมที่เลือก
Description-tl.UTF-8: Error sa pagpalaki ng volume group
Extended_description-tl.UTF-8: Hindi madagdag ang physical volume ${PARTITION} sa napiling volume group.
Description-tr.UTF-8: Cilt grubu genişletilirken hata oluştu
Extended_description-tr.UTF-8: ${PARTITION} fiziksel cildi seçilen cilt grubuna eklenemez.
Description-ug.UTF-8: كېڭەيتىلگەن دىسكا گۇرۇپپىسىدا خاتالىق كۆرۈلدى
Extended_description-ug.UTF-8: فىزىكىلىق دىسكا ${PARTITION} نى تاللىغان دىسكا گۇرۇپپىسىغا قوشقىلى بولمايدۇ.
Description-uk.UTF-8: Помилка при розширенні групи томів
Extended_description-uk.UTF-8: Не вдалося додати фізичний том ${PARTITION} до вибраної групи томів.
Description-vi.UTF-8: Gặp lỗi khi mở rộng nhóm khối tin
Extended_description-vi.UTF-8: Không thể thêm khối tin vất lý ${PARTITION} vào nhóm khối tin đã chọn.
Description-zh_CN.UTF-8: 扩展卷组时出错
Extended_description-zh_CN.UTF-8: 物理卷 ${PARTITION} 不能被加入到所选卷组中。
Description-zh_TW.UTF-8: 在擴充 Volume Group 時發生錯誤
Extended_description-zh_TW.UTF-8: 無法將 Physical Volume ${PARTITION} 加入至指定的 Volume Group 中。

Name: partman-lvm/vgextend_names
Type: select
Choices: ${GROUPS}
Description: Volume group to extend:
Extended_description: Please select the volume group you wish to extend.
Description-am.UTF-8: የሚያድገው የይዘት ግሩፕ፦
Extended_description-am.UTF-8: እባክዎ ማሳደግ የሚፈልጉትን ይዘት ግሩፕ ይምረጡ፡፡
