Name: partman/active_partition
Type: select
Choices: ${DESCRIPTIONS}
Description: Partition settings:
Extended_description: You are editing partition #${PARTITION} of ${DEVICE}. ${OTHERINFO} ${DESTROYED}
Help: partman-target/help
Choices-C: ${CHOICES}
